# Tracked output directory for Instagram-asset renders.
# Local social-* scripts write here. The IG cron reads from this path
# (on origin/main) and sends to Telegram on the scheduled day.
#
# Files: <slug>.webp (single) + <slug>.base.webp (untitled, for --retitle),
#        <slug>.jpg (Telegram-safe fallback),
#        <slug>/slide-NN.png (carousel slides).
